    "description": "In efforts to develop an overarching vision and a 5 to 10 year game plan for its Research Unit, the Aga Khan University School of Nursing and Midwifery, AKU-SONAM, held the Research Retreat 2022 on December 26 and 27, 2022, with participation and contribution from leadership, research experts and faculty members of the University.",
